% model_router — TokenRouter auto selection without Opus

# Module: model-router

TokenRouter provides one key across vendors but no server-side auto model alias.
Create pure TypeScript `eligibleModels` and `chooseModel` over its live catalog.
This app calls OpenAI-compatible chat completions, so only text models advertising
`openai`, `openai-compatible`, or `chat-completions` endpoints are eligible.
Exclude image/video/audio/embedding models and exclude every model ID containing
the Opus family. Select deterministically by `cheap | standard | hard`, prefer
fast models for cheap, balanced models for standard, strongest non-Opus models
for hard, highest versions first, then model ID ascending. An explicit preference
wins only if eligible. Empty eligible catalogs raise `NoEligibleModel`. No I/O.
